OL,3,GNEWSAInshore rescue's new permanent
OL,4,Abase a 'godsend'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA volunteer water rescue team has
OL,7,Fwelcomed the granting of permission for
OL,8,Fa new permanent base as a "godsend".
OL,10,FUlverston Inshore Rescue had operated
OL,11,Fon the Furness coastline from a site at
OL,12,FCanal Foot owned by pharmaceutical
OL,13,Fcompany GSK for more than 20 years.
OL,15,FWhen GSK closed its factory in August
OL,16,F2025, the charity said it "generously
OL,17,Fgifted" the land, with Westmorland and
OL,18,FFurness Council now approving plans to
OL,19,Fbuild storage facilities, welfare units
OL,20,Fand parking for rescue vehicles.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
