OL,3,GNEWSAInshore rescue's new permanent
OL,4,Abase a 'godsend'
OL,5,
OL,6,FStation officer Bruce Chattaway said
OL,7,Fwithout the gift, the team would "have
OL,8,Fhad nowhere to go".
